WEBVTT

00:00:03.010 --> 00:00:07.210
Kobayakawa-san, after this,
would you like to go see the tree?

00:00:07.930 --> 00:00:09.250
Kobayakawa-san?

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:10.220
Um...

00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:12.280
I need to go make a call.

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:13.320
Oh, sure.

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:14.880
I'm sorry.

00:00:19.890 --> 00:00:21.360
Welcome back.

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:22.600
Was it okay?

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:25.100
Um, I'm terribly sorry, but...

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:27.490
I need to do something for a bit.

00:00:27.490 --> 00:00:29.980
Could you wait here for a little while?

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:31.410
Huh? Right now?

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:32.740
Is everything okay?

00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:34.410
Would you rather go home?

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:37.010
No. Um...

00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:37.960
Don't worry.

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:41.840
I'll be right back. I'm sorry.

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:43.080
See you in a bit.

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:43.770
Huh?

00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:50.250
Kobayakawa-san?

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:54.020
What is it... you need to go do?

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:31.020
<i>She hasn't come back.</i>

00:02:33.030 --> 00:02:35.980
<i>She said she'd be right back...</i>

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:39.790
Sir?

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:44.180
I'm terribly sorry.

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:46.950
Unfortunately, we are very busy today,

00:02:47.420 --> 00:02:50.650
so there is a two-hour limit on tables.

00:02:52.370 --> 00:02:54.040
Thank you for coming!

00:02:57.780 --> 00:02:59.920
<i>Brr! It's so cold!</i>

00:03:00.190 --> 00:03:02.830
<i>I forgot there was a time limit.</i>

00:03:07.930 --> 00:03:10.460
<i>No word from Kobayakawa-san.</i>

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:22.770
<i>She's not answering.</i>

00:03:28.420 --> 00:03:31.900
<i>For now, I guess I should
find somewhere to wait.</i>

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:35.320
I'm terribly sorry.

00:03:35.320 --> 00:03:37.040
We're full at this time.

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:39.830
<i>Oh, of course.</i>

00:03:43.210 --> 00:03:46.420
I wanna be your knight!

00:03:50.140 --> 00:03:51.640
Merry Christmas.

00:03:52.940 --> 00:03:54.490
Mattsun's the best!

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:07.820
I hear something.

00:04:07.820 --> 00:04:08.800
Do you?

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:16.940
Wow, snow!

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:18.720
It's a white Christmas!

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:25.030
It's snowing just for you and me!

00:04:25.030 --> 00:04:27.920
I'm quite sure this is just regular snow...

00:04:38.770 --> 00:04:43.060
<i>Right. It's Christmas. Every place is packed.</i>

00:04:46.740 --> 00:04:49.440
<i>And now it's snowing more heavily...</i>

00:04:52.650 --> 00:04:55.090
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:59.250
<i>I wonder what happened with Kobayakawa-san.</i>

00:05:06.690 --> 00:05:09.670
Um... I need to go make a call.

00:05:10.340 --> 00:05:12.420
I have something I need to go do.

00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:15.010
Could you wait here for a little while?

00:05:15.430 --> 00:05:18.500
I'll be right back. I'm sorry.

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:19.590
See you in a bit.

00:05:22.740 --> 00:05:25.880
<i>Did something happen to her family?</i>

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:28.190
<i>But she'd have gone home for that.</i>

00:05:28.940 --> 00:05:30.990
Here. It's a present for you.

00:05:31.280 --> 00:05:32.280
Thank you.

00:05:33.240 --> 00:05:35.210
<i>Don't tell me she's with Mocchi?!</i>

00:05:36.970 --> 00:05:38.700
<i>She double-booked on me!!</i>

00:05:39.120 --> 00:05:43.120
<i>No, no... Kobayakawa-san
wouldn't do something like that.</i>

00:05:43.600 --> 00:05:47.130
<i>What else... Maybe she
actually did have work today?</i>

00:05:47.130 --> 00:05:49.430
<i>But then she wouldn't be coming back.</i>

00:05:49.430 --> 00:05:53.060
<i>Oh, didn't this happen
after I mentioned the tree...</i>

00:05:53.060 --> 00:05:56.320
<i>Maybe she just didn't want to go?</i>

00:05:56.320 --> 00:06:00.060
<i>But then she would've had some reason for it...</i>

00:06:01.410 --> 00:06:04.040
<i>Ugh, it's freezing out here!</i>

00:06:04.040 --> 00:06:06.580
<i>I should've bundled up more.</i>

00:06:07.420 --> 00:06:09.700
<i>I know, I'll go to a convenience store.</i>

00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:10.780
<i>Where to find one?</i>

00:06:13.410 --> 00:06:16.470
<i>No... I shouldn't.</i>

00:06:16.470 --> 00:06:18.410
<i>I'll stay outside.</i>

00:06:18.870 --> 00:06:21.220
<i>If go someplace warm,</i>

00:06:21.220 --> 00:06:24.120
<i>I might start overthinking things again.</i>

00:06:27.870 --> 00:06:30.500
<i>Kobayakawa-san told me she'd be back soon.</i>

00:06:31.380 --> 00:06:33.470
<i>I just have to wait.</i>

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:36.650
<i>Why do I feel so uncertain?</i>

00:06:37.530 --> 00:06:40.110
<i>It's not like we're going out...</i>

00:06:41.480 --> 00:06:43.860
<i>But then, that's exactly why
I want to stay calm.</i>

00:06:45.510 --> 00:06:47.210
<i>I really am...</i>

00:06:48.640 --> 00:06:49.950
<i>...such a wimp.</i>

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:21.830
Here.

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:34.110
Oh, thank you.

00:07:34.110 --> 00:07:34.920
It's nothing.

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:39.320
She's passing out tissues on Christmas?

00:07:39.700 --> 00:07:41.500
But it's so cold out...

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:46.580
Here, you can have this, if you like.

00:07:46.580 --> 00:07:48.680
I won't be needing it.

00:07:48.680 --> 00:07:49.500
Huh?

00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:53.820
Make sure you don't catch a cold, Santa-san!

00:07:56.630 --> 00:07:58.010
<i>Exactly one year ago.</i>

00:07:58.980 --> 00:08:02.210
<i>I met her that day purely by chance.</i>

00:08:03.320 --> 00:08:05.430
<i>But, ever since then.</i>

00:08:05.720 --> 00:08:06.810
<i>I've been...</i>

00:08:21.270 --> 00:08:22.700
<i>Kobayakawa-san?</i>

00:08:26.240 --> 00:08:27.040
Hashiba-kun?

00:08:30.120 --> 00:08:31.530
Why are you outside?

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:33.630
You could have waited inside.

00:08:33.630 --> 00:08:35.550
<i>It's Kobayakawa-san.</i>

00:08:36.300 --> 00:08:37.800
<i>It's really her.</i>

00:08:39.170 --> 00:08:40.880
The table had a two-hour limit.

00:08:41.240 --> 00:08:43.260
It did?

00:08:43.260 --> 00:08:46.650
I'm so sorry! I took so long...

00:08:46.650 --> 00:08:47.930
<i>Thank goodness.</i>

00:08:47.930 --> 00:08:51.570
What should I do? Honestly...
I was in such a hurry!

00:08:51.570 --> 00:08:53.600
I shouldn't have left.

00:08:53.600 --> 00:08:54.870
<i>Thank goodness.</i>

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:56.900
Oh, right!

00:08:57.210 --> 00:08:59.190
Um, here.

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:00.760
For you.

00:09:03.300 --> 00:09:04.530
Gloves?

00:09:04.530 --> 00:09:06.390
They're a Christmas present.

00:09:07.330 --> 00:09:09.370
Though I've opened it myself...

00:09:09.370 --> 00:09:10.620
Could you try them on now?

00:09:12.420 --> 00:09:15.940
I forgot these at work.

00:09:15.940 --> 00:09:17.660
They called to tell me.

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:20.590
Um... I was hurrying to go get them back,

00:09:20.590 --> 00:09:23.070
so I didn't check my phone...

00:09:23.070 --> 00:09:24.550
Um...

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:27.030
Your hand is so cold!

00:09:27.030 --> 00:09:28.810
I really am sorry...

00:09:30.830 --> 00:09:31.990
There.

00:09:36.160 --> 00:09:39.110
They're warm. Thank you.

00:09:42.160 --> 00:09:44.730
Y-You're welcome.

00:09:44.730 --> 00:09:47.940
Oh, right.
I had a present for you, too.

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:49.800
Uh, it's in my bag.

00:09:49.800 --> 00:09:51.700
Um, Hashiba-kun.

00:09:51.700 --> 00:09:54.120
Let's go inside somewhere first.

00:09:56.900 --> 00:09:59.500
Oh, sorry.

00:09:59.500 --> 00:10:00.970
What?

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:02.670
I think I bumped into her.

00:10:02.670 --> 00:10:04.580
What? You're not sure?

00:10:08.270 --> 00:10:08.870
Uh...

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:13.520
Um... I'm sorry!
For bumping into you...

00:10:14.280 --> 00:10:15.940
<i>Yeah...</i>

00:10:16.240 --> 00:10:18.110
<i>It's Kobayakawa-san...</i>

00:10:19.320 --> 00:10:22.780
<i>If I let go of her, she might leave again...</i>

00:10:26.020 --> 00:10:27.110
Hashiba-kun?

00:10:27.110 --> 00:10:27.990
<i>I mean...</i>

00:10:28.890 --> 00:10:30.410
<i>...I have to tell Kobayakawa-san...</i>

00:10:31.310 --> 00:10:33.330
<i>...how I feel about her...</i>

00:10:34.420 --> 00:10:36.250
<i>But...</i>

00:10:36.250 --> 00:10:39.170
<i>...her face is just too close...</i>

00:10:39.760 --> 00:10:41.590
<i>She's so cute...</i>

00:10:41.590 --> 00:10:44.130
<i>No, I have to tell her.</i>

00:10:44.130 --> 00:10:47.390
<i>Kobayakawa-san, I...</i>

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:50.920
<i>I love you.</i>

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:55.180
<i>Please go out with me.</i>

00:10:55.820 --> 00:10:58.860
<i>Huh? Did I actually say it?</i>

00:10:58.860 --> 00:11:02.110
<i>Did I? Did I say it out loud?</i>

00:11:02.790 --> 00:11:05.040
Ha-Hashiba-kun?

00:11:05.040 --> 00:11:06.860
<i>Did I or did I not?</i>

00:11:06.860 --> 00:11:08.260
<i>I'm not sure.</i>

00:11:10.510 --> 00:11:13.890
<i>I'm not sure, and... now...</i>

00:11:13.890 --> 00:11:14.620
Huh?

00:11:15.670 --> 00:11:17.790
<i>I feel...</i>

00:11:19.330 --> 00:11:20.710
<i>Sorry.</i>

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:24.630
<i>...I'm...blacking out...</i>

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:26.890
Hashiba-kun?

00:11:26.890 --> 00:11:28.150
Hashiba-kun?!
